 "remarks": "Experience a newly completed in 2026 turnkey luxury home in South Wilton, a beautifully reimagined 4-bedroom, 3.5-bath, 3,700sqft home where sophisticated design and extensive upgrades create effortless modern living. Major NEW addition featuring a 3-car garage and a luxurious Primary Suite above. The NEW designer custom kitchen features abundant cabinetry, a walk-in pantry, and all-new appliances. An elegant dining room flows into the spacious living room, where a wall of NEW windows fills the space with natural light. A large family room offers an inviting setting for entertaining and everyday living. Upstairs, the stunning brand-new-built Primary Suite is your private retreat with soaring 10+ ft vaulted ceilings, oversized windows, a room-sized walk-in closet, and a luxurious ensuite bath \"to-die-for\". Three additional generously sized bedrooms include one with an ensuite bath featuring a glass shower and double vanity, while the other two share a hall bath with a tub. A spacious second-floor laundry room adds convenience.  Newly done hardwood floors run throughout. Extensive improvements include new HVAC, plumbing, electrical, windows, drywall, lighting, doors, trim, kitchen, appliances, and exterior walkways. Professionally landscaped grounds feature level, private lawns, a large deck with contemporary lighting, and a charming covered front porch. A whole-house Generac generator provides added peace of mind. Beautifully finished and available for immediate occupancy.",
